@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@postId = 0

### GET all
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts

### GET by id - replace postId with the id returned by POST
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}

### POST - copy returned id into postId above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My lab post",
  "content": "React -> Axios -> ASP.NET Core -> EF Core -> SQLite",
  "author": "Student"
}

### PUT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated lab post",
  "content": "Updated using PUT",
  "author": "Student"
}

### DELETE - deletes only the chosen record
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}

### Validation - expected 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "content": "", "author": "Student" }
